":"\"You don't need to baby me, Oniichan.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After losing her home in a fire, Suzuka is set to be separated from her beloved Oniichan as she moves into Hoshikuzu Dormitory. Luckily for her, however, the dorm gets a new mother (male) and it happens to be... her brother?!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sweet girl who's also a bit of a brocon, Suzuka must learn to become independent and cope with her new environment. Will she learn to rely on her brother less, or will they bond grow ever stronger?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Description from Steam Page"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c133161"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd506798e1ad3d80792432b65f99ebcfdaad4e6142e9315a15ca083cfd100ac5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf375e720ad873e18e4b775ab19a98160f57a4e951d8134bb1a4d2b4eef0df89.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"森谷 こころ","creatorId":"vndb:s3660","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3660","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3660","name":"佐々木 未来","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96670","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c153845","characterName":"八乙女 哲也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c153845"},"originalCharacterName":"八乙女 哲也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddef62ad5bb42e2a9920f41cef11fccb358a7a1e42202df618d8cb1f5d394e40.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6d1525fb1bcadb77b3a83173967d491ca57